<title>UK: Halifax average price at tender 733.1p/shr.</title>
<headline>Halifax average price at tender 733.1p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly-floated Halifax Plc said on Thursday that the average price of bids in a daily tender held Wednesday was 733.1p per share.</p>
<p>Halifax had orders to sell about 2.94 million shares at the daily tender, representing about 0.1 percent of the firm's share capital.</p>
<p>Britain's biggest mortgage lender made its debut on Monday on the London stock market.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
